; Stained Glass OS -- desktop icons (Settings > Personalization > Themes >
; Desktop icon settings, on Windows): This PC and the user's own folder beside
; the Recycle Bin, which Windows shows by default. 0 shows an icon, 1 hides it;
; wine-sg 0090 draws them.

